// Constant tables of the HEVC (H.265) decoder: CABAC state machine and
// context initialisation values (ITU-T H.265 9.3.2.2, Tables 9-5 to 9-37),
// coefficient scan orders (6.5.3 to 6.5.5), the transform matrix (8.6.4.2),
// intra prediction angles (8.4.4.2.6), interpolation filters (8.5.3.3.3),
// default scaling lists (Tables 7-5 and 7-6), chroma QP mapping (Table
// 8-10) and the deblocking tC / beta tables (Table 8-12).
//
// Reading a module-level list costs more than reading a field, so the
// decoder copies the tables it uses in hot loops into its own structs once.
//
// Author: Alexius Academia
// Date: 2026-10-25

